WEBVTT

00:09:59.756 --> 00:10:02.476
I totally cannot accept that,

00:10:02.516 --> 00:10:09.196
because a city is made up
of concrete and steel.

00:10:09.196 --> 00:10:10.356
It's long-term.

00:10:10.716 --> 00:10:14.596
You cannot say, "Oh, I built
a 50-story building today,

00:10:14.636 --> 00:10:16.676
and I accept that five years later,

00:10:16.716 --> 00:10:19.916
I'll pull it down
for changed circumstances."

00:10:19.956 --> 00:10:21.476
It's not possible.

00:10:21.516 --> 00:10:22.716
But on the other hand,

00:10:22.756 --> 00:10:26.476
you can ask, "How can we be sure

00:10:26.516 --> 00:10:29.636
that whatever we build
will last a long time?"

00:10:29.676 --> 00:10:33.356
My answer is that if you spend time